================================================================================
SOFTWARE ENGINEERING CURRICULUM GUIDELINES & PROJECT RUBRIC
Course: CS404 | Academic Year 2026
================================================================================

1. Evaluation Criteria:
   - SRS Document & Architecture: 20%
   - Sprint Deliverables & Git Commit History: 30%
   - Unit Test Coverage (>80% required): 20%
   - Final Demo & Code Review: 30%

2. Core Recommended Methodologies:
   - Scrum Framework with 2-week Sprint cycles
   - Test-Driven Development (TDD)
   - CI/CD workflow with GitHub Actions
